      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "unchecked exception\n\nThis are Exception\nwhich are not cheked\nat compile time\ncompiler compile code\nand jvm execute it\nwheather it is\nhandled by\nprogrammer or not .\n\nError ,\nRuntimeException\nand all there child are\nuncheked exception",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "unchecked exception\n\nThis are Exception which are not cheked at compile time compiler compile code and jvm execute it wheather it is handled by programmer or not .\n\nError , RuntimeException and all there child are uncheked exception",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hDvXhNeKmY_KOqEbtqrtU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 764,
      "y": 738,
      "width": 198.00000000000003,
      "height": 1050,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 340526031,
      "version": 674,
      "versionNonce": 2059476111,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788956384459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "checked Exception\n\nThis Exception are\ncheked at compile\ntime if they are not\nmanaged by\nprogrammer then\ncompiler does not\ncompile the code .\n\nProgrammer either\nhave to do 2 things\n\n1. handle either\nusing try catch.\n\nor \n\n2. use throws\nkeyword in the\nmethod header\nfollowed by checked\nexception name\nwhich we do not\nwant to handle .\n\nThen it will become\nresponsibility of\ncaller to handle it\nor throws again .\n\nThis is called handle\nor declare rule .\n\nAll Exception which\nare not Error ,\nRuntimeExcetion\nand there child fall\nunder checked\nexception .\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "checked Exception\n\nThis Exception are cheked at compile time if they are not managed by programmer then compiler does not compile the code .\n\nProgrammer either have to do 2 things \n\n1. handle either using try catch.\n\nor \n\n2. use throws keyword in the method header followed by checked exception name which we do not want to handle .\n\nThen it will become responsibility of caller to handle it or throws again .\n\nThis is called handle or declare rule .\n\nAll Exception which are not Error , RuntimeExcetion and there child fall under checked exception .\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
